1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:06,957
Every product begins with a need. But what happens to the ideas that manufacturers haven't imagined yet?

2
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:16,765
What if the next great product began with you? Introducing PayPal GENESIS.

3
00:00:24,134 --> 00:00:32,759
An idea. A problem. Something you wish existed. Describe it in GENESIS, and give that possibility a starting point.

4
00:00:41,634 --> 00:00:52,484
GENESIS Intelligence, powered by Google's Gemini AI, turns an early idea into structured, editable product requirements. A clearer starting point for the people who can build it.

5
00:00:59,834 --> 00:01:06,555
One idea becomes part of a community. People discover it, support it, and share what needs to improve.

6
00:01:13,434 --> 00:01:27,264
On the other side, manufacturers discover what customers are asking for. With AG Grid and AG Studio, demand becomes interactive intelligence, helping teams explore opportunities and make informed decisions.

7
00:01:36,634 --> 00:01:43,570
Manufacturers can review the requirements, propose solutions, set pricing, and manage the journey toward production.

8
00:01:50,934 --> 00:02:00,643
And when an eligible offer is ready, PayPal brings the purchase journey together through a tested Sandbox checkout, verified payment capture, and order tracking.

9
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:14,120
From the first idea to the next opportunity. The future of products starts with people.
